~ start

if not GameState.was_event_seen("rosie_grave_seen")
	$> GameState.mark_event_seen("rosie_grave_seen")
	PLUM: The writing is impossible to read. (sad)
	PLUM: I can only make out the words "I didn't" and "Rosie".

	- Pay respect
		$> GameState.mark_event_seen("rosie_grave_respected")
		You pray for Rosie.
		=> END

	- Do nothing
		=> END

else
	if GameState.was_event_seen("rosie_grave_flower")
		$> show_node("Sprite2D2")
		You don't know... but you think Rosie will appreciate this.
		=> END

	else
		if GameState.was_event_seen("rosie_grave_respected")
			if GameState.has_flower
				You've already paid your respects here.

				- Lay the flower here
					$> GameState.has_flower = false
					$> GameState.mark_event_seen("rosie_grave_flower")
					$> show_node("Sprite2D2")
					VINCENT: Are you done wasting time?
					PLUM: Not wasting time! (angry)
					You don't know... but you think Rosie will appreciate this.
					=> END

				- Keep the flower to yourself
					You didn't have to give the flower, but you still feel like a bad person.
					=> END

			else
				You've already paid your respects here.
				=> END

		else
			PLUM: The writing is impossible to read. (sad)
			PLUM: I can only make out the words "I didn't" and "Rosie".

			- Pay respect
				$> GameState.mark_event_seen("rosie_grave_respected")
				You pray for Rosie.
				=> END

			- Do nothing
				=> END